sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant TED as TED-SWS Entity Resolution task (Originator)
  participant ERS as Entity Resolution Service (App Service)
  participant ORCH as ERS Orchestrator (App Component)
  participant SOR as Request Registry / System of Records (App Component)
  participant REG as Canonical Entity Registry (App Component)
  participant MQ as Messaging Middleware (Broker/Transport)
  participant ERE as Entity Resolution Engine (App Component)

  TED->>ERS: ResolveEntity(requestId, originId, entityType, entityRepresentation)
  ERS->>ORCH: forward request (service invocation)

  ORCH->>SOR: record ResolutionRequest (persist mention + metadata)
  ORCH->>REG: lookup existing canonicalId? (by originId+requestId) [optional]

  alt already resolved / cached
    REG-->>ORCH: canonicalId
    ORCH->>SOR: record ResolutionDecision(status="reused")
    ORCH-->>ERS: canonicalId (+warnings)
    ERS-->>TED: 200 canonicalId (+warnings)
  else needs resolution by ERE
    ORCH->>MQ: publish ResolutionRequest (C4) [async]
    MQ-->>ERE: deliver ResolutionRequest (C4)

    ERE->>MQ: publish ResolutionResult (C5) [async]
    MQ-->>ORCH: deliver ResolutionResult (C5)

    ORCH->>REG: upsert membership (mention -> cluster/canonicalId)
    ORCH->>SOR: record ResolutionDecision(confidence, similarity, evidenceRef)

    ORCH-->>ERS: canonicalId (+warnings)
    ERS-->>TED: 200 canonicalId (+warnings)
  end

  opt ERE unavailable / timeout
    ORCH-->>ERS: error 503 (service_unavailable)
    ERS-->>TED: 503 + error_code/message
  end
